[Chapter "Without c4"]
[Line "Against the Colle (2.Nf3 and e3)"]
[Opening "Queen's Pawn Game: Colle System, Anti-Colle"]

{A quiet setup without c4. With no pressure on d5, the bishop comes out at once.} 1. d4 d5 {Claim the centre.} 2. Nf3 Nf6 {Develop.} 3. e3 {A quiet Colle-style setup.} 3... Bf5 {With c4 not played, the bishop comes out at once.} 4. Bd3 Bxd3 {Trade off White's best attacking bishop.} 5. Qxd3 e6 {A solid pawn chain.} 6. O-O c5 {Strike at d4 now that White has castled.} *
